#: ../../solid/periodic_electronic_states.rst:2
msgid "周期系の電子状態"
msgstr "Electronic States in Periodic Systems"

#: ../../solid/periodic_electronic_states.rst:4
msgid ""
"周期境界条件のもとでブロッホの定理を導き、電子状態を波数で分類して、許される波数を数えます。独立な波数を選ぶ範囲として\\ "
":ref:`第1ブリルアンゾーン<first-brillouin-zone>`\\ と、その中の\\ :ref:`Γ点・高対称点<high-"
"symmetry-points>`\\ を導入します。最後に、同じ結晶を超胞で記述したときの\\ :ref:`バンドの折り返し<pbc-band-"
"folding>`\\ を考えます。"
msgstr ""
"We derive Bloch's theorem under periodic boundary conditions, classify "
"electronic states by wave vector, and count the allowed wave vectors. We "
"introduce the \\ :ref:`first Brillouin zone <first-brillouin-zone>`\\  as"
" the region from which to choose independent wave vectors and identify "
"the \\ :ref:`Γ point and high-symmetry points <high-symmetry-points>`\\  "
"in it. Finally, we consider \\ :ref:`band folding <pbc-band-folding>`\\  "
"when the same crystal is described using a supercell."

